  {
    "id": "1179409",
    "original": "いつも行く店はカルビーのポテチが９８円。うす塩が俺のお気に入りだ。このうす塩味、実は時期によって原材料が変わる。今日のは化学調味料なしの自然塩。俺的に当たりだ。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "1487856",
        "text": "The store that I always go to has Calbee potato chips on sale for 98 yen a bag. My favorite flavor is lightly salted. As a matter of fact, the ingredients for this particular flavor changes from time to time. Today's chips are chemical-free, made with natural salt. Fitting for someone like me."
      }
